        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 11 In case CPS' certificates associated with the (elliptic curve) EC as specified by [V2G20-2674] have been revoked, but the SA (eMSP) requests it to sign the SignedInstallationData with the certificates based on (elliptic curve) EC as specified by [V2G20-2674], the CPS could not be able to oblige the SA (eMSP). It is not in the scope of this document to define the CPS behavior under these conditions. CPS can have certificates based on (elliptic curve) EC as specified by [V2G20-2319] that it can use for signing the SignedInstallationData.",
